        "TileImage": "$($repository fd0fae44-e1e3-47ac-9ab3-1312638e681b).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rYour destination is a balcony in Dartmoor, England. Your targets are five operatives gathered at the estate. Due to the distances involved, marksmanship is required. While intelligence indicates a hunting rifle on premises, its firepower and suppression are inadequate. You would be wise to supply your own rifle.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
